# Hangman Game (Python)

## Description
A text-based Hangman game built using Python. The player guesses letters to uncover a hidden word before running out of lives.

## Features
- Random word selection
- Visual hangman stages
- Life tracking system
- Win and lose conditions

## Files
- `hangman_game.py` – Main game logic
- `hangman_words.py` – Word list used in the game
- `hangman_art.py` – Hangman stages and game logo

## Level
Beginner Project

